[2026-10-02 22:40:45 EDT]   [Review] What failed: 1) T1 was a rate-limit fallback (HTTP 429) — the pilot made no decision on the single most important turn of the game; this is now the 5th straight game with 1+ fallback turns. 2) Drogon died on T4 at 17% HP. The board was 2 foes at 1% and 5% HP; Heat Wave was not needed from Drogon at all — Milotic Scald alone KO'd Sneasler, and Drogon could have Protected (or we could have switched it) and survived to close the game at full value. We traded our 394%-damage win condition for zero marginal value because both targets were already dead to one action. 3) Whimsicott died on T2 at 1% HP without contributing (Moonblast into Kangaskhan was fine, but it was already a dead piece from T1 Heat Wave friendly-fire-less chip + Last Resort). 4) We never got Tailwind up at all (us 0 turns, them 3) and still won — but only because Drought/Heat Wave outpaced their board; against a bulkier team this is a losing pattern.
